# Pairs with CausalOrder. Discards a dead-letter without a lost mark (#4603).
MODULE: CausalOrderDiscardLeavesNoMark
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a discarded dead-letter leaves no lost mark, so its dependents are released
PERTURBS: Discard

--- FIND
    /\ lost' = lost \cup {h}
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no lost mark.
    /\ lost' = lost
--- END
